{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9bf069cc9d05233e2351ed9d235b76c00f81a70d3f9fafdbaf2abbe3ea7bceafc483f305efcd819913ef6f5d13ec5dd9191d04ad74ee2d28adf6b10b008a05ae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d550318e5e5099d6c8c42f45bf699d5d3b47ae6b16b040ee6438125efb6403b00c398fcf531b6e83e71a850d18c89c3a0fe2c0bed90f97cbe8d0d90609a2f32a1eaef41547aa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/73ead51c11fe5132c3c0a1fab70408f1b271940d3f3b57ec59a6ae7f0bb28c0bda3b9066dc5d3366b44e539b4bff18425bf1f4a54ca732860577b92d399c424e068056149eb53872bc9b58fafe03182306e82c138f565f854f341ea9503408f6d1a5fb3ad66ef4af2f6a9909b4c123f091e8253c55581235\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/74a407b7d4626df187c3ba47b66304aa6e7adf89fb813adb6a8ff7afc4f290bafee76cd661476696aa021b9e81e77a632f1ca3ad8e8ce5fb9d4408b0ee5dc241334ca3a1bd41262c24d16d299713e381f55f718d6ff944df05f3085ed456d957b76b624ba2141b1a4bd1d5692233384ee4c0a3499a9d4afd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d630acc037ca6555a9137a6cd329e3c5e951f00fba25c01ef28a948cad8feedf2170fa4d4a374def9f2dc51c7b8fc12f6913b344d24818dc43e8de0390bbc302b627f7ddaa6d01a52671aaa0d9af82320962f48b46ea3317dce45dea8060ccab0f2a151dc96c6fa88c640eea9115d5f9cdcc5ee8be1fc0f8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6bb5bb43b0011572dd04e106132f8c8abe28f931d45abc426c28f437011a640fae0c712305731709d2449dce36600cdf63392765f9fa6065bb3e646b22b81a077dd800d6298aac54c6fc39f186b79a6d759b2cf6dc35ab717432a3755dd077ce9e0c4d3c9264cab611a628cbd097a39a39767070b78f35b7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7d92c588a14e10a60084fc59a81f64b211f7925f03ba48a7df309084b9cf104b5a41b05d609651f57455af9afe559f897ad7666fdc5fd118b05d4439edd9f9e22a3eb1c6fc85e47c489b55b995bfa87029a5971c91a03fec1e1b0744f2b2f8e5c43b6eb889ec0e5ada4fe894a72b6e3ff4f2899bec8fd7d9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3ac2d3eed26633ecd9f33098a393682597bf8d8033165c799088c5e1eabcbfd6447e29b4adda6f61103baebc0bb1b17cf96bf6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c7c296ce906aeb8da964a5c40c946795df262e3b95521a757514398c39e23ebbc3fab16b8b8c7700e04fc3fee3f2f7d84daa2b592d762586a710212ba1dca22960d0bfbbfba0f00a79506cce4fe6df774fc0ac6616f27bdf00900ac0a4470dd3f8fb6a3fb10ae5893d28db30c428639c9899cfae9727e49d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cda84682f6a6fcf19a754edd13a218cfef8a8e996afd517a81acd75605d694bbc41c11dee8fa22042880098f7aa3643a938d4680f34ec6e3c486d3ac92fae3b39ffdf8448c3a5621a3ccc299e2a54da7168f97d9156e09027fcb1e5b2a3c2f01cce0bd01933304e0425c695cd506d42e8ece8e0a47f3de74\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fcb236cf1d47822ba8ee9fb88ce322ab651ce1534a82f5b563e670c7691c634867ad12e1b03f5cd5ff336f8ff18979625093befbf0bebedc561c0d4cf75d7e217f968d4dbd290b3c881e519adae852fd97ad1535c87ce1f12282bafbc43685203ecf171bfac9e0edf9cf408c130f00d4d08ee33568679075\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/04b252b0d4e0b7da35f517028abfb22b0aa469840631d96d3b816fbabcd029b9fc63a8ecd520d15175d37a392f00344bb3046266056ab1f521f48dca6759f3c60beac2207803d70ac405f3bdd32f92e8d222428dacf718bc8954c149b41e2a4e7fa75175ebb07b81e595be60d97371a68227436a1424b738\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/50d1164c7acc299f53831d819860be5303ce5234f8ff8de60abd4f82751c7e2c1c1545f9d06ad99ca5a72aeb2f7e280b0de5a644d7cd8b79df5dadeec03298a9215c5364e8dae1d9c4806864221b9c9002148a2e4f894ff6183613d66160edfb4e52b3f74fedeca266a210444d7281e2a489c47eb7f4182f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/88b8374572916567c5ef966fe3094967e16cd82584928360353eef090de0d89e1045b6ecae65be0a8e9b3d5239b50b5b967619d4fe50cda27535deda6c86af687a22a72b867eeba870b07eb353078ad04b29d2c2560e7ef3b86beeec33cbef4ae737e7d22ce481ffda249ab72c11c055b7b9faec1521ce37\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f2d8b1608c8c088913a960b9e83bb80116807fe6be1718bb2260810a904fcf022b5204d4d98943962bf44b4d753aa70969af47741eb2d80452767d46da4cf4b2246cae3e261aa9f5de7ae7271c4bc0df84a3f7d15636ce38c5feb9df3002fff8e8ed52bb92f4aa09ee9c3ffcf5538654574af30820b64359\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/49c1a4dc03c0c9dc9d4e86897fd6aee96223f7affe49a170543290a1af86a68c2d95dff145dde0d13b4b5ca54104f3970c4fc6e07842cd9324f2c44c0f8006c9007bbbb1064d6877cac3294cf559b788d96374ddf5f4500174ce9b10cd375a7dc3ebb45b57e5d6fe1dad715857c8e0ce8b0d3f558cea8787\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/61f1f53c4c943c51263bc50e6c2418b97584cbf949ff7ddc23f9f0802fc0460c396816df08762caebd2cdddc128936dbe3cdecb6dcacdbae19b9fd9c88e3ddc15e1441289bf2e26dd5e5b304209c2651f4369b4d1b0db59a889a65f8b06589908c4a71faafab9d1fc356143307f76995b6d82ee3a8fa1544\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/38e6a1c2b3cdb0217c996685f092eaff9d0d2af126ce652ae96e67a612a038052a43c9e972af3adb920051a19e49ccf313e3dc236f4dbebb2312a3f1406423ed51953b5782a8fbe377923e8966544127aeca08695a43b65094f4053a671527a551280fe7aef8625ea04bb1218c7b75385cd855e58d9fcac2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b9a696970f24e4873efde3a47c11b2585ddff1653f16f1a2c7322f2b5fd1b263e1e8357af2e5192a4dfb687ccfea2ee4e32872a60da37156629836495a10dab369249b705420f7dd5905ce01eed8759ec6d65ecd5177aff7cd85779b0d30a5163688acec746dd24afe793ff3b98455577ee9952709864e85\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a2787876ff52c104d2520c979a69fda4651ca822e1a704976a50381d728494d9da750d0afc9cfc0918103d5430ef99d6cc913a9132e10a10a1efcdaf8b299f0c555e39e97494723f85bc8be32f42712d0b5a8e268e52cbe29f44d7276f04119925f3fa337307143383e879d90b7562df4ad2a151a3e0150c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/06e88051772c67c1afc65c739fd62607006403db48952485e6b5f356cb3bb4c97c634f0622dc718bd9881df85dc86099d02cdb592db6bdf2e21cc8ace29c5b383cc3fb5949b0ba5ee6c4dd1fe8f9379b52973c0c6e2e0faab2b1fc0aaa69ad85bc6e62fc729102152981496b03b0acfb772adf2f8f9fffce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f4d8251d595dd498e8456258bfd284e39ccbcd4ffc30240e06b91059ae0da2677b18f4f04c8c040c16e71b3c107b5a87ed571a5c1f6d644b5d1bdba2688fe91de9e8e9d4723f04553c9a85bda8cb7be7eaafeaf55edbd086cc58ec9ec1b2f04fae7f1b87967ae5cafdfa1b3af67ff6cea93b584423e9b973\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/809b2571206d2fb14bf17b955911f33b01bfb254ae141a216659f6b82480c6bedd2d2e09e4a3f4c8d1d40fcbec980be15f3fa84d2b62cc4858c79c98974470c99ab83553a68ff9be480227ddff1b25862c5eb40d5970970759726435ef9e1276950c87306f5437ca965bc1fe3398e56c6a4ca62fa3f90237\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5704221af28112e5eab79286c4a389d6e67f04cbaf1822e96f095f02cb03665d7e0ef2dd31c4de19c58ad00021b59c20afeecb7991128791243e733bde2b15d765352cbb53086d5cfad047553d8a4c9815e17628c7070eed9cc299add3752db1ef31edacbc38becf3f444f1f6e2776b12c5c44ba2a000178\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4892cf046c37b7db00ee7a13a2953d04f9e548818778bc16c4950ac74b797063d590206383afbdfed95d8088443deeea947b67855f905b8f14bd47968026b46ea5fb0e2a253b8e7e70ef9d8d39f5de196a4bc469953238a29af7ea7dbefe93311fecfbfbc2721a8467f7d093162f67a0833a63655f5fc35b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b0311f951ffa2d6bd698dea4f5dc4b57e89e345b72fb68584f5c9701c2e0f3fb30471c6122d13c6f2fac430a1b2df69441fc06d1bde9cc26a09220b5d3c73794da21b9a7baa6768250e0a6f5c5b456278676e974f52aa34dc760a0e1e420be9dc75c3d79ce8bd287aabed2e4bbce6888ffc2313cc9242f42\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/93b2a831234ed656ef521504b66bbee9bc16c2870acf932d00615a739db55d3161a23e898f58d8cab05055f9a313a9bc4c84b361a2338aceeadbc94114f0f2843ff1c185ea9638510989fb6cf63ef4191b66bd6b1c3b4d10cc3a19d04177ff2773a523273ea548cfc0cbf2c5eda28b7fb6e1ca1e7d118a60\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/185fd13bd01c5ecdb4870f1f13cb2d72b240b501153ab6a7da12e574f369dc658f6df5d85840ffe54b68a4048a2c7376bde70a1e186bc09bb1ab98f60a5ab61ffda106e112bdd8d0bc900432589afc55aefd15218f971deeee630c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/90801e4966595fcd4802655c04609212904d6f763242e5f45c09f449836ff846e01fa6dc628f84adea56c18ef1ca92889d0a97e657e0d6b367ed3dcf6175e013d7740ae3a1a8107e717f7bbfd9b661ec1fa5f7bdbecf47f9b7dc30b21fb72ac2e8a15a33c2c24867b8f93af26a06e31818aee64bc4cc6147\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a38de96aab857994609516ba48df610a8bfb209014a93cca85960a737145493c1a99ff0d9a6807c45ec79c6cd85d97a366f1a4c8f32d9409c72a136fe85b1dd2c9d97a0ac87ac4a0780be62ddfbcae7cdd1b9c6550d2ec5a62e197d322486ec4e95155970aa0f240fe6f8cb4530309ce38430ee565d1ed0b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c62d771526aef2546ec811cf03d5190b81909a9d615152622c4260e3f70a70000e0dd8a4ff08b1f9e6dd5ae26e189eb99117534dfd31d42c5d3ad17088ba6ca37d72a0fc302528d0226d5461d1d81540ad78bcfd0da78746caa447e8b9598707a582c1a57ef462973b34e4a8a85314ca353d972489fd5a95\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fda52ebd684788d57594a50efcec236a795763bfc811e32d34640e0d0d61de5602d5119e6996920bc8a9555eb1fa6429871dc66f4d228b2d517b2fffd60a1282130eed8f3b4290881d4802e36c472a5e5010e6bc9409405881ad232122da8ca291cb7241e65f5fff70a75af8038a296b2fa807a2afc0a491\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/08e2473c9d2fbf5f64f00e9a4eb04d11d243c86388e17676d3c96fdd011a8b8754379d73e5dc6ad3425ba8658f07c3de12a1bbd2514ca1f2ee9e38a7b71e4c9449cbea3fc7a1df9961cc108db0b1b5d110543b08309b71b2359dc4275e2e0ae5d73ec8f0613b8171e02b66ea0af2fe6d732c00ce161482d5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/06677c21614c576edb870c2eb7c636549dee5fd6fe6da73ae7030a3e58d6c030050148a481957427c7ea81ed63802e3e556584cfc0e131850e9373519f61ba31e3d7b8b6ab9ac81c6dc0074c587a45c4e8d63ef800bf1d351c15ac59d8381785236275ed8960d9e3ada165b5c32e7043cf224f596322015c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fb0031f61bb0a28954ab5c4a63d44fcaa9ee101ae232be562cb8ad728b15926e0f5fe94b37ff030044ab502d76cfcbb806cdea46a70f27517e50a6fdae11627d2b2a67dc377a62f174079b74bb41ff0209548dccef648fd9e6daa9664799cec98dc4483bbfccf7652c54b4884f47315f5b2d7ac9216c2e63\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
